@startuml FoodRescue_Food_Request_State

title FoodRescue — Food Request State Diagram

[*] --> Pending : Request submitted

Pending --> Approved : Donor / Admin approves
Pending --> Rejected : Donor / Admin rejects
Pending --> Cancelled : Recipient cancels
Pending --> Expired : Food expires

Approved --> Allocated : Allocation created
Approved --> Cancelled : Request cancelled

Allocated --> Completed : Redistribution completed
Allocated --> Expired : Food expires
Allocated --> Cancelled : Allocation cancelled

Rejected --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Expired --> [*]
Completed --> [*]

@enduml